  "notes": "Single-accent design: #007db8 blue for titles, checked boxes, progress fills and active rail item; everything else greys on #f8f9fa. Completed tasks greyed (#9ca3af) with strikethrough. Each card header row: chevron, blue link title (opens source note), tiny grey folder chip, light-blue 'Note' chip, right-aligned 120px progress bar, 'n / m' count, eye-slash hide icon. Unchecked tasks show faint calendar icon at row end that opens a Due date modal (date, time, repeat, remind-me toggle). Filter popover uses rounded pill chips with coloured priority flags. Left 52px icon rail with grouped separators and collapse handle."
